{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a familiar yet subtly wrong version of modern day Shibuya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine morning commute quietly unravels. You awaken in your office after hours. Everyone is gone. The city lights outside feel distant, artificial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.poster.avif?t=1759795331\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.webm?t=1759795331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.mp4?t=1759795331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the 32nd floor, you must descend through echoing corridors, sealed elevators, and rooms that seem to rearrange themselves when you're not looking. Along the way, you\u2019ll gather fragments of a forgotten device, each \u201cshard\u201d unlocking strange messages and impossible truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.poster.avif?t=1759795331\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.webm?t=1759795331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.mp4?t=1759795331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you navigating a glitch in space\u2026 or your own fractured memory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal, hyper-realistic reimagining of Shibuya\u2019s corporate interiors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate from floor 32 to the street through immersive, detail-rich spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover shard fragments to decode a hidden AI language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric puzzles and spatial storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ambient soundscape that blurs the line between simulation and reality</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805820?t=1759795331","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/22a58236d112324e635e8473d46c10eb7d983315/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759795331","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/afdd97250a4a1a08df218d97627ddfba24029966/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759795331","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/afdd97250a4a1a08df218d97627ddfba24029966/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759795331","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a familiar yet subtly wrong version of modern day Shibuya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine morning commute quietly unravels. You awaken in your office after hours. Everyone is gone. The city lights outside feel distant, artificial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l